# This folder (and everything under it) holds withheld source files - see README.md in this same
# folder for the full explanation of what is withheld, why, and the contract a third party must
# implement to restore real functionality. Every *.cs file anywhere under here (this applies
# recursively, so it covers Private\QAdvanceFeedback\*.cs and Private\QAdvanceFeedback.Tests\*.cs
# alike) is ignored - that is the whole point: withheld implementation/test code must never be
# committed to the public repository. This .gitignore and README.md themselves are explicitly kept.
*.cs
!.gitignore
!README.md
